{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":198400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":13911.418577,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":14347.898021,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":14403.613558000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14405.536568000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14406.823212000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14408.492511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":14410.216122,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14411.835005,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":20784.264552,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben, denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21305.521607,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie “The Templar Legacy,” you might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21360.515348,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21362.511949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21363.835569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21365.600472000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21367.379556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21369.146352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21370.062669,"samples":22392,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":380},{"kind":"input","t":32095.9676,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen."},{"kind":"text","t":32325.820704,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for a variety of reasons."},{"kind":"audio","t":32372.264714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":32373.816397,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32375.497894000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32376.331988,"samples":22296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":370},{"kind":"input","t":32923.741182,"text":"die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":33103.495692,"text":"ranging from neglect to abuse to extortion."},{"kind":"audio","t":33147.100474,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33148.4678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33149.282483999996,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":280},{"kind":"input","t":42756.454952,"text":"Das Cochamotal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Yosemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":43309.232214999996,"text":"Cochamó Tal is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s Yosemite National Park, with a multitude of large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":43368.952680999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":43370.351714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43372.125901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43373.860859,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43375.681054999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43377.421490999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":43379.23031,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43381.023766,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43382.362578,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":54935.475049999994,"text":"Aristoteles Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":55224.750682,"text":"Aristotle’s views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":55273.961051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55275.407033999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55277.145166999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55278.749407999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55279.996402,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":58063.753663999996,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":58349.240701999996,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":58395.774396999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58397.349785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":58399.085343,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":58399.311793999994,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":58444.353085999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58445.638688,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58447.35610999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":58447.587147,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":70293.94630000001,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":70742.82397,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and Lafasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":70796.769296,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70798.216501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":70800.03174,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70801.635741,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70803.341966,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70804.734799,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":72315.865699,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":72531.50637,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":72576.97163900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72578.405564,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72579.98339600001,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":84786.31003800001,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht. Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":85055.249983,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital. He passed away shortly thereafter."},{"kind":"audio","t":85103.150273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":85104.425069,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85106.16554500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":85106.28697700001,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":85141.80986200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85143.30614100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":85143.46498,"samples":4664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":94667.04982700001,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse. Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":95022.133856,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts. Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":95072.12848300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95073.63089100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95075.333671,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95077.15521900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":95077.269901,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":95116.353158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":95117.910418,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95119.629342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95120.87796900001,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":100639.420413,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":100912.246299,"text":"If one speaks a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":100960.631297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100962.215798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":100963.87863800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":100965.65770200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1120},{"kind":"audio","t":100965.809771,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":113003.08720400001,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":113386.973075,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":113439.495352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113440.851901,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113442.444375,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":113444.262277,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":113446.023594,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":113446.247451,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118845.419509,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":119257.052076,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":119314.566596,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1200},{"kind":"audio","t":119316.117297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119317.80562500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119319.523447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119321.25767400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":119323.10202600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119324.998737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":119325.142202,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129392.70246300001,"text":"der australier mitchell gurley wurde elfter im stehenden super g der männer der tschechische konkurrent aldrich jelinek wurde sechzehnter im sitzenden super g der männer"},{"kind":"text","t":129976.28629100001,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing Super G, while Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek came in sixteenth in the men’s sitting Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":130036.19740399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130037.66354700002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130039.331835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130041.05881100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130042.92461500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130044.83477600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130046.577446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":130047.58448,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":141711.232839,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":142158.78037,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that Nepal’s UN peacekeeping battalion inadvertently brought the disease to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":142219.475702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142220.86274699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":142222.55957699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142224.346273,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":142226.17169599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142227.958532,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":142229.73984999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":142231.545033,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142233.424088,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"audio","t":142233.59755799998,"samples":6888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":153440.08577499999,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland. Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam."},{"kind":"text","t":153820.54491899998,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany. He also attacked everything that went into the water."},{"kind":"audio","t":153873.637376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153875.17577799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":153876.85783599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153878.7835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153879.871805,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"audio","t":153914.82753699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":153916.37474199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153917.52235699998,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":156020.358468,"text":"Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":156307.602738,"text":"Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex wasn’t a match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":156353.379321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156355.049681,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156356.68332699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":156357.092071,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":168503.094648,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":168943.896064,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kin